+/**
+ * Stands in for jenkins-core's class, which is not on the gate's classpath, so that
+ * {@code import jenkins.model.Jenkins} in vars/utils.groovy resolves. Groovy dispatches the
+ * library's calls on it at run time, so the compile needs the class to exist and nothing more.
+ */
